    "name": "Art Blocks Generator API",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "description": {
      "content": "Returns an iframe-able live view of the generative artwork associated with a given Art Blocks token. The live view runs the artist's on-chain script in the browser using the token's deterministic hash as a seed, producing the canonical on-chain artwork output. Useful for embedding live artwork in external applications and marketplaces.\n\nContact Support:\n Name: Art Blocks Developer Documentation",
      "type": "text/plain"
    }
